<title>UK: United News jumps on EMAP defection.</title>
<headline>United News jumps on EMAP defection.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in United News &amp; Media jumped to their highest level in almost a month following a report that an EMAP Plc executive was joining the company, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0854 GMT, United News shares were up 16p to 702-1/2p.  </p>
<p>EMAP said David Arculus, its managing director, was leaving to take the chief operating officer post at United News.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
